    {
        "id": 5,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_106_franka_1\", name2=\"char_002_amiya_1\", focus=1)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_106_franka_1.png",
        "name2": "char_002_amiya_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 6,
        "raw": "[name=\"Franka\"]   Phew...",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Franka",
        "content": "Phew..."
    },
    {
        "id": 7,
        "raw": "[name=\"Franka\"]   L.G.D.'s escort team has managed to leave safely.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Franka",
        "content": "L.G.D.'s escort team has managed to leave safely."
    },
    {
        "id": 8,
        "raw": "[name=\"Franka\"]   But... it doesn't look like our enemies have any intention on letting us go.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Franka",
        "content": "But... it doesn't look like our enemies have any intention on letting us go."
    },
    {
        "id": 9,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_106_franka_1\", name2=\"char_002_amiya_1\", focus=2)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_106_franka_1.png",
        "name2": "char_002_amiya_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "id": 10,
        "raw": "[name=\"Amiya\"]   As long as they don't know that Misha has left with the L.G.D., they'll continue to focus their efforts on us.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Amiya",
        "content": "As long as they don't know that Misha has left with the L.G.D., they'll continue to focus their efforts on us."
    },
    {
        "id": 11,
        "raw": "[name=\"Amiya\"]   Misha will be safer this way.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Amiya",
        "content": "Misha will be safer this way."
    },
    {
        "id": 12,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_107_liskam_1\", name2=\"char_002_amiya_1\", focus=1)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_107_liskam_1.png",
        "name2": "char_002_amiya_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 13,
        "raw": "[name=\"Liskarm\"]   Now that I think about it, why are both Reunion and Lungmen after this kid?",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Liskarm",
        "content": "Now that I think about it, why are both Reunion and Lungmen after this kid?"
    },
    {
        "id": 14,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_107_liskam_1\", name2=\"char_002_amiya_1\", focus=2)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_107_liskam_1.png",
        "name2": "char_002_amiya_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "id": 15,
        "raw": "[name=\"Amiya\"]   I can't say for sure. There are a lot of possibilities.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Amiya",
        "content": "I can't say for sure. There are a lot of possibilities."
    },
    {
        "id": 16,
        "raw": "[name=\"Amiya\"]   My best guess is that either she, or something she knows, is significant enough to determine Lungmen's continued safety.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Amiya",
        "content": "My best guess is that either she, or something she knows, is significant enough to determine Lungmen's continued safety."
    },
    {
        "id": 17,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_106_franka_1\", name2=\"char_002_amiya_1\", focus=1)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_106_franka_1.png",
        "name2": "char_002_amiya_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 18,
        "raw": "[name=\"Franka\"]   Something?",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Franka",
        "content": "Something?"
    },
    {
        "id": 19,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_106_franka_1\", name2=\"char_002_amiya_1\", focus=2)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_106_franka_1.png",
        "name2": "char_002_amiya_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "id": 20,
        "raw": "[name=\"Amiya\"]   Yes, perhaps some intel or information...",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Amiya",
        "content": "Yes, perhaps some intel or information..."
    },
    {
        "id": 21,
        "raw": "[name=\"Amiya\"]   So that's why both Lungmen and Reunion are after her.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Amiya",
        "content": "So that's why both Lungmen and Reunion are after her."
    },
    {
        "id": 22,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_107_liskam_1\", name2=\"char_002_amiya_1\", focus=1)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_107_liskam_1.png",
        "name2": "char_002_amiya_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 23,
        "raw": "[name=\"Liskarm\"]   What a dangerous contest...",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Liskarm",
        "content": "What a dangerous contest..."
    },
    {
        "id": 24,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_107_liskam_1\", name2=\"char_002_amiya_1\", focus=2)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_107_liskam_1.png",
        "name2": "char_002_amiya_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "id": 25,
        "raw": "[name=\"Amiya\"]   And none of us can stay out of it, not us, Misha, or the L.G.D.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Amiya",
        "content": "And none of us can stay out of it, not us, Misha, or the L.G.D."
    },
    {
        "id": 26,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_106_franka_1\", name2=\"char_002_amiya_1\", focus=1)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_106_franka_1.png",
        "name2": "char_002_amiya_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 27,
        "raw": "[name=\"Franka\"]   Hopefully we don't end up caught in the crossfire.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Franka",
        "content": "Hopefully we don't end up caught in the crossfire."
    },
    {
        "id": 28,
        "raw": "[name=\"Franka\"]   We don't know anything, but we have to take care of everything...",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Franka",
        "content": "We don't know anything, but we have to take care of everything..."
    },
    {
        "id": 29,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_106_franka_1\", name2=\"char_002_amiya_1\", focus=2)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_106_franka_1.png",
        "name2": "char_002_amiya_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "id": 30,
        "raw": "[name=\"Amiya\"]   I, I'm not quite sure...",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Amiya",
        "content": "I, I'm not quite sure..."
    },
    {
        "id": 31,
        "raw": "[name=\"Amiya\"]   But as for Madam Ch'en...",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Amiya",
        "content": "But as for Madam Ch'en..."
    },
    {
        "id": 32,
        "raw": "[name=\"Amiya\"]   I have a hunch... that things aren't going to end so smoothly.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Amiya",
        "content": "I have a hunch... that things aren't going to end so smoothly."
    },
