    {
        "id": 39,
        "raw": "[name=\"Exusiai\"]   Amiya, is there anything left for us to do?",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Exusiai",
        "content": "Amiya, is there anything left for us to do?"
    },
    {
        "id": 40,
        "raw": "[name=\"Exusiai\"]   Should we accompany you back to Rhodes Island?",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Exusiai",
        "content": "Should we accompany you back to Rhodes Island?"
    },
    {
        "id": 41,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_002_amiya_1\", name2=\"char_103_angel_1\", focus=1)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1.png",
        "name2": "char_103_angel_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 42,
        "raw": "[name=\"Amiya\"]   No thank you. Nothing is holding us back in combat anymore, so we should be fine.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Amiya",
        "content": "No thank you. Nothing is holding us back in combat anymore, so we should be fine."
    },
    {
        "id": 43,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_102_texas_1\")]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_102_texas_1.png"
    },
    {
        "id": 44,
        "raw": "[name=\"Texas\"]   If that's the case, we'll head back and wait for further orders.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Texas",
        "content": "If that's the case, we'll head back and wait for further orders."
    },
    {
        "id": 45,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_002_amiya_1\")]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1.png"
    },
    {
        "id": 46,
        "raw": "[name=\"Amiya\"]   No problem.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Amiya",
        "content": "No problem."
    },
    {
        "id": 47,
        "raw": "[name=\"Amiya\"]   Moving forward, I hope you'll continue to keep an eye out on Reunion's movements within Lungmen.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Amiya",
        "content": "Moving forward, I hope you'll continue to keep an eye out on Reunion's movements within Lungmen."
    },
    {
        "id": 48,
        "raw": "[name=\"Amiya\"]   Even though we've handed Misha over to the L.G.D., the fact that Reunion is here... still makes me uneasy.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Amiya",
        "content": "Even though we've handed Misha over to the L.G.D., the fact that Reunion is here... still makes me uneasy."
    },
    {
        "id": 49,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_002_amiya_1\", name2=\"char_103_angel_1\", focus=2)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1.png",
        "name2": "char_103_angel_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "id": 50,
        "raw": "[name=\"Exusiai\"]   Easily done~ We'll be on our way now~",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Exusiai",
        "content": "Easily done~ We'll be on our way now~"
    },
    {
        "id": 51,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_002_amiya_1\", name2=\"char_103_angel_1\", focus=1)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1.png",
        "name2": "char_103_angel_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 52,
        "raw": "[name=\"Amiya\"]   Mhm. I'll leave you to it.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Amiya",
        "content": "Mhm. I'll leave you to it."
    },
    {
        "id": 53,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_002_amiya_1#7\")]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#7.png"
    },
    {
        "id": 54,
        "raw": "[name=\"Amiya\"]   Everyone, we don't know how many more Reunion members there are in hiding.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Amiya",
        "content": "Everyone, we don't know how many more Reunion members there are in hiding."
    },
    {
        "id": 55,
        "raw": "[name=\"Amiya\"]   Make sure to stay prepared and alert.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Amiya",
        "content": "Make sure to stay prepared and alert."
    },
    {
        "id": 56,
        "raw": "[name=\"Amiya\"]   Next, we'll continue to relocate our operations within these high-rises.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Amiya",
        "content": "Next, we'll continue to relocate our operations within these high-rises."
    },
    {
        "id": 57,
        "raw": "[name=\"Amiya\"]   If necessary, we can even use the rooftops.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Amiya",
        "content": "If necessary, we can even use the rooftops."
    },
    {
        "id": 58,
        "raw": "[name=\"Amiya\"]   This way, we'll have a terrain advantage versus having to fight Reunion out in the streets.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Amiya",
        "content": "This way, we'll have a terrain advantage versus having to fight Reunion out in the streets."
    },
    {
        "id": 59,
        "raw": "[name=\"Amiya\"]   If necessary, we'll draw them towards areas that we control!",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Amiya",
        "content": "If necessary, we'll draw them towards areas that we control!"
    },
